ps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T14:53:14Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T14:53:14Z","body":"> If the scene dock is floating, it will not be brought forward when highlighting happens\r\n\r\nThat's Wayland bug.\r\nAnd also `make_visible()` does not bring floating docks to top (there is a separate method for that); I plan to address it eventually. It's unrelated issue.\r\n\r\n> If the dock was hidden, it will be made visible again. I wouldn't call this a problem, but I would like to confirm if this is intentional.\r\n\r\nWell, the intent is to show the node in Scene dock, for which the Scene dock has to be visible. It's expected behavior. (and it's the same for any other dock when `make_visible()` is called)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5440922235/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5442846321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104456#issuecomment-5442846321","issue_url":"https:/